~ start
Dealer: Are you going to push your luck? You right now have
- Hit
	do hit()
	if has_player_busted()
		Dealer: What a misfortune, you busted!
	else
		=> start
- Stand
	do stand()
	if has_player_won()
		Dealer: Congrats! You win.
	else
		Dealer: Should've tried harder! Better luck next time.

Dealer: Want to play again?
- Play again
	do start_game()
	=> start
- Stop => END
=> END